AV writer of the audio helper truncates while pcm_f32_to_s16\nrounds, so wav and pcm differ by one LSB. Both now round.\n\npcm_f32_to_s16 takes a pointer and a count and converts the TTS\nbytes without an intermediate copy.\n\n/tts and /v1/audio/speech parse their body with parse_tts_body, so\nmultipart fields such as speed get their type before the speech\nconversion checks them.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Pascal <admin@serveurperso.com>\n\n</details>\n\n**Website:**\n- <https://llama.app>\n\n**Attestations:**\n- <https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/attestations/65593042>\n\n**macOS/iOS:**\n- [macOS Apple Silicon (arm64)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12238/llama-b12238-bin-macos-arm64.tar.gz)\n- macOS Apple Silicon (arm64, KleidiAI enabled) [DISABLED](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/pull/23780)\n- [macOS Intel (x64)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12238/llama-b12238-bin-macos-x64.tar.gz)\n- [iOS XCFramework](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12238/llama-b12238-xcframework.zip)\n\n**Linux:**\n- [Ubuntu x64 (CPU)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12238/llama-b12238-bin-ubuntu-x64.tar.gz)\n- [Ubuntu arm64 (CPU)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12238/llama-b12238-bin-ubuntu-arm64.tar.gz)\n- [Ubuntu 24.04 s390x (CPU)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12238/llama-b12238-bin-ubuntu-s390x.tar.gz)\n- [Ubuntu 26.04 s390x (CPU)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12238/llama-b12238-bin-ubuntu-26.04-s390x.tar.gz)\n- [Ubuntu 26.04 s390x (zDNN)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12238/llama-b12238-bin-ubuntu-zdnn-s390x.tar.gz)\n- [Ubuntu x64 (Vulkan)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12238/llama-b12238-bin-ubuntu-vulkan-x64.tar.gz)\n- [Ubuntu arm64 (Vulkan)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12238/llama-b12238-bin-ubuntu-vulkan-