x86 (310p)\n- openEuler x86 (910b, ACL Graph)\n- openEuler aarch64 (310p)\n- openEuler aarch64 (910b, ACL Graph)\n\n**UI:**\n- [UI](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12238/llama-b12238-ui.tar.gz)"},{"tag_name":"b12237","created_at":"2026-11-09T22:36:31Z","body":"<details open>\n\nmtmd: support gemma 4 input audio stream (#31965)\n\n* mtmd: support gemma 4 input audio stream\n\n* use 480ms step\n\n* server: enable realtime embeddings only for audio generation\n\nThe realtime slot forced embeddings on, which marks every row of a\nbatch as an output. Only a model that generates audio reserves\nn_batch outputs, so a chat model with an audio stream (Gemma 4)\naborted on its first batch of audio rows. The hidden state is only\nread by the audio generation pipeline.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Pascal <admin@serveurperso.com>\n\n</details>\n\n**Website:**\n- <https://llama.app>\n\n**Attestations:**\n- <https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/attestations/65581072>\n\n**macOS/iOS:**\n- [macOS Apple Silicon (arm64)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12237/llama-b12237-bin-macos-arm64.tar.gz)\n- macOS Apple Silicon (arm64, KleidiAI enabled) [DISABLED](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/pull/23780)\n- [macOS Intel (x64)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12237/llama-b12237-bin-macos-x64.tar.gz)\n- [iOS XCFramework](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12237/llama-b12237-xcframework.zip)\n\n**Linux:**\n- [Ubuntu x64 (CPU)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12237/llama-b12237-bin-ubuntu-x64.tar.gz)\n- [Ubuntu arm64 (CPU)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12237/llama-b12237-bin-ubuntu-arm64.tar.gz)\n- [Ubuntu 24.04 s390x (CPU)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12237/llama-b12237-bin-ubuntu-s390x.tar.gz)\n- [Ubuntu 26.04 s390x (CPU)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12237/llama-b12237-bin-ubuntu-