6/llama-b12236-bin-win-openvino-2026.4.1-x64.zip)\n- [Windows x64 (SYCL)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12236/llama-b12236-bin-win-sycl-x64.zip)\n- [Windows x64 (ROCm 10.0)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12236/llama-b12236-bin-win-rocm-10.0-x64.zip)\n\n**openEuler:**\n- [DISABLED](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/pull/23705)\n- openEuler x86 (310p)\n- openEuler x86 (910b, ACL Graph)\n- openEuler aarch64 (310p)\n- openEuler aarch64 (910b, ACL Graph)\n\n**UI:**\n- [UI](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12236/llama-b12236-ui.tar.gz)"},{"tag_name":"b12233","created_at":"2026-11-09T18:41:01Z","body":"<details open>\n\nfeat: external PLE file loading (#31185)\n\n* model : allow loading external PLE files\n\nAssisted-by: Codex\n\n* convert : add separate PLE exports\n\nAssisted-by: Codex\n\n* tests : fix PLE export test lint\n\nAssisted-by: Codex\n\n* model : make --ple an alias of --shard, allow multiple shard locations\n\nReuse the multi-shard loading path for external PLE files instead of a\nseparate option.\n\n* --ple is an alias of --shard: both take a comma separated list and may\n  be given more than once, and the shards may live anywhere\n* metadata comes from the main file; numbered shards are still\n  auto-discovered and strictly validated\n* explicit files outside the discovered set are appended as extra shards,\n  exempt from split.no and split.count checks\n* -isnm/--ignore-shard-num-mismatch loads only the given files, in order,\n  with no auto-discovery and no split metadata validation\n* ple_path, path_ple and llama_model_loader::add_ple_file are removed;\n  common_model_load() uses llama_model_load_from_splits for two or more\n  paths\n* common/fit.{h,cpp} take the shard path vector, so --fit and the router\n  memory measurement load every shard\n\nAssisted-by: GPT-6-Astra\n\n* rm -isnm\n\n* make sure to dedup paths\n\n* rm test_convert_ple\n\n* address comments\n\n* allow ple shard to override tensor\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Xuan Son Nguyen <son@huggingface.co>\n\n</details>\n\n**Website:**\n- <https://llama.app>\n\n**Attestations:**\n- <https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/attestations/65488847>\n\n**macOS/iOS:**\n- [macOS Apple Silicon (arm64)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12233/llama-b12233-bin-macos-arm64.tar.gz)\n- macOS Apple Silicon (arm64, KleidiAI enabled) [DISABLED](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/pull/23780)\n- [macOS Intel (x64)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12233/llama-b12233-bin-macos-x64.tar.gz)\n- [iOS XCFramework](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12233/llama-b12233-xcframework.zip)\n\n**Linux:**\n- [Ubuntu x64 (CPU)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12233/llama-b12233-bin-ubuntu-x64.tar.gz)\n- [Ubuntu arm64 (CPU)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12233/llama-b12233-bin-ubuntu-arm64.tar.gz)\n- [Ubuntu 24.04 s390x (CPU)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12233/llama-b12233-bin-ubuntu-s390x.tar.gz)\n- [Ubuntu 26.04 s390x (CPU)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12233/llama-b12233-bin-ubuntu-26.04-s390x.tar.gz)\n- [Ubuntu 26.04 s390x (zDNN)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12233/llama-b12233-bin-ubuntu-zdnn-s390x.tar.gz)\n- [Ubuntu x64 (Vulkan)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12233/llama-b12233-bin-ubuntu-vulkan-x64.tar.gz)\n- [Ubuntu arm64 (Vulkan)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12233/llama-b12233-bin-ubuntu-vulkan-arm64.tar.gz)\n- [Ubuntu x64 (CUDA 12)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12233/llama-b12233-bin-ubuntu-cuda-12.8-x64.tar.gz) - [CUDA 12.8 libraries](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12233/cudart-llama-b12233-bin-ubuntu-cuda-12.8-x64.tar.gz)\n- [Ubuntu x64 (CUDA 13)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp