s arm64 (OpenCL Adreno)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12230/llama-b12230-bin-win-opencl-adreno-arm64.zip)\n- [Windows x64 (CUDA 12)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12230/llama-b12230-bin-win-cuda-12.4-x64.zip) - [CUDA 12.4 DLLs](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12230/cudart-llama-bin-win-cuda-12.4-x64.zip)\n- [Windows x64 (CUDA 13)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12230/llama-b12230-bin-win-cuda-13.5-x64.zip) - [CUDA 13.5 DLLs](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12230/cudart-llama-bin-win-cuda-13.5-x64.zip)\n- [Windows arm64 (CUDA 13)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12230/llama-b12230-bin-win-cuda-13.5-arm64.zip) - [CUDA 13.5 DLLs](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12230/cudart-llama-bin-win-cuda-13.5-arm64.zip)\n- [Windows x64 (Vulkan)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12230/llama-b12230-bin-win-vulkan-x64.zip)\n- [Windows arm64 (Vulkan)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12230/llama-b12230-bin-win-vulkan-arm64.zip)\n- [Windows x64 (OpenVINO)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12230/llama-b12230-bin-win-openvino-2026.4.1-x64.zip)\n- [Windows x64 (SYCL)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12230/llama-b12230-bin-win-sycl-x64.zip)\n- [Windows x64 (ROCm 10.0)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12230/llama-b12230-bin-win-rocm-10.0-x64.zip)\n\n**openEuler:**\n- [DISABLED](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/pull/23705)\n- openEuler x86 (310p)\n- openEuler x86 (910b, ACL Graph)\n- openEuler aarch64 (310p)\n- openEuler aarch64 (910b, ACL Graph)\n\n**UI:**\n- [UI](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12230/llama-b12230-ui.tar.gz)"},{"tag_name":"b12229","created_at":"2026-11-09T13:10:11Z","body":"<details open>\n\nserver : fix response_format json_schema when schema is not nested in the json_schema wrapper (#28697)\n\n* server : accept top-level schema in response_format with type json_schema\n\nThe OpenAI-compatible chat completions endpoint only applied the schema\nwhen it was nested inside response_format.json_schema.schema. When the\nschema was provided directly as response_format.schema (as documented in\nthe server README, and used by some clients), it was silently ignored\nand generation ran unconstrained.\n\nAlso mention json_schema in the error message for invalid response_format\ntypes, document the OpenAI wrapper form in the README, and add a test\ncase for the top-level schema form.\n\nFixes #10732\n\n* server : let the json_schema wrapper take precedence by presence\n\nPick the schema source based on whether response_format has a\njson_schema key, instead of falling back when the parsed wrapper schema\nis empty. An empty schema {} is valid (any JSON value), so the old check\nlet a top-level schema override an explicit {} in the wrapper. Use\njson_value() for the top-level schema too, like the rest of the\nfunction, and add tests for the precedence.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: linsen <251731047+linsen458-spec@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n</details>\n\n**Website:**\n- <https://llama.app>\n\n**Attestations:**\n- <https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/attestations/65440886>\n\n**macOS/iOS:**\n- [macOS Apple Silicon (arm64)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12229/llama-b12229-bin-macos-arm64.tar.gz)\n- macOS Apple Silicon (arm64, KleidiAI enabled) [DISABLED](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/pull/23780)\n- [macOS Intel (x64)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12229/llama-b12229-bin-macos-x64.tar.gz)\n- [iOS XCFramework](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12229/llama-b12229-xcframework.zip)\n\n**Linux:**\n- [Ubuntu x64 (CPU)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12229/llama-b12229-bin-ubuntu-x64.tar.gz)\n- [Ubuntu arm64 (CPU)](h